Maybe I don’t need an abstract? That’s fine. I’ll write the counterexample as a "Proposition." In Step 3, I’ll focus on the coordinates, letting \(C \subset M_{2,1}\) represent the varying genus 2 component curve, and I’ll define \(B = \{Y_0\} \times C\).

